<title>SPAIN: Spain June jobless falls to 13.06 pct vs 13.26 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain June jobless falls to 13.06 pct vs 13.26 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish Labour Ministry supplied the following figures:</p>
<p>  UNEMPLOYMENT	   JUNE 97     MAY 97	JUNE 96</p>
<p> Total (million)		 2.09	  2.12	  2.23</p>
<p> Change on month	-31,881     -57,866     -33,149</p>
<p> Pct of workforce	 13.06	 13.26	 14.15</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures are based on registered unemployed.</p>
</text>
